    "Wider mixed-type coercion, Numbers native error mappings, unequal range shapes, whole axes, dynamic/named targets, localized criteria and other producer versions remain unqualified.",
    "The native Numbers document remains explicit partial editable reconstruction because inherited cell padding is omitted.",
    "MINIFS/MAXIFS no-match zero is qualified; matched nonnumeric extrema and wider coercion remain unsupported without replacing caches.",
    "Only recorded native versions and bounded criteria/function profiles are qualified.",
